# Cloudflare Pages _headers for the published report (copied to docs/_headers
# by run.sh step 08; GitHub Pages serves it as an inert file).
#
# No Cache-Control rules on purpose: Pages' default (max-age=0,
# must-revalidate, with an ETag) keeps index.html and its sidecars from the
# same deploy. The px/ shards are offsets into prices_meta.json's dates axis,
# so a shard cached from yesterday's deploy next to today's axis would draw a
# series shifted by a day. Revalidation is a cheap 304 from the edge.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
